{"entryId":"3218","paragraphs":[{"sourceId":"heilprin:sefaria-warsaw:ta:3218:1","sourceSha256":"e448a04c9bb794cd10b1a7d56f2a7a08207b596335863edee41f5eb8934141ea","englishSha256":"00a3202e836ed6cec65ec79d77fbf8f2bda9e353d71d8c81538ef7b432545a31","citations":[{"id":"3218:1:link-001","he":[0,60],"en":[0,11],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Beitzah_15b.21"},"reference":"Beitzah 15b:21","assessment":"The Bavli names Rav Tahlifa as Ravnai’s brother at the end of 15b. The checked Rif gives Tahlifa as his father and separately transmits the brother reading.","evidence":[{"reference":"Beitzah 15b:21","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Beitzah_15b.21"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Rif Beitzah 8b:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rif_Beitzah_8b.1"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"}]},{"id":"3218:1:link-002","he":[0,60],"en":[61,68],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rif_Beitzah_8b.1"},"reference":"Rif Beitzah 8b:1","assessment":"The Bavli names Rav Tahlifa as Ravnai’s brother at the end of 15b. The checked Rif gives Tahlifa as his father and separately transmits the brother reading.","evidence":[{"reference":"Rif Beitzah 8b:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rif_Beitzah_8b.1"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"},{"reference":"Beitzah 15b:21","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Beitzah_15b.21"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]}],"inlineHebrew":[0],"holds":[],"notes":[{"text":"The Bavli explicitly gives brother. The Rif gives both father and brother, preserving uncertainty in the transmission.","references":[],"urls":[]}],"comparisonEvidence":[{"reference":"Beitzah 15b:21","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Beitzah_15b.21"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Rif Beitzah 8b:1","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Rif_Beitzah_8b.1"},"witness":"Vilna Edition"}]}],"entryEvidence":[]}
